    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Person was granted restricted stock units (&quot;RSUs&quot;), which each represent a contingent right to receive one share of ordinary stock of Ceragon Networks Ltd. (the &quot;Company&quot;). The RSUs vest in four equal annual installments (25% per year) commencing on 03/23/2027 subject to the Reporting Person's continued service to the Company or its subsidiaries through each vesting date.</footnote>
